 >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8+ hours of gameplay across over a 40 islands. Discover all the secrets!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sailing with wind physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate by the stars, landmarks, and your trusty compass. Figure out where you are on your own!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles to solve, both in and out of dream sequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming characters, stories, and a deep history behind this unknown archipelago</p></li></ul>","developers":["Second Fiddle Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631930/3e91aeadeec378bdd956fe0ec618d5660f3fbad5/header.jpg?t=1762723353","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3631930/1644144579/686ee8d5f4210d71a5a6ac8558036ce52746a2c7/1757020037/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757044527","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3631930/1644144579/686ee8d5f4210d71a5a6ac8558036ce52746a2c7/1757020037/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757044527","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3631930/1644144579/686ee8d5f4210d71a5a6ac8558036ce52746a2c7/1757020037/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757044527","id":257193308,"name":"Trailer 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257193308/04f6b2f3773322843ae90f125bc8d29f38bfd6c7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757044527"}],"name":"Grey Wake","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated with CPU or discrete<br></li><li><st